Z||000000||fierospeeder||05-20-2001||05:09 AM||||I a lover and owner of a 74 vw beetle.  Read vw trends.<P>In their magazine, they said how VWOA (Volkswagen of America) is now sueing businesses that sell toys tshirts etc.. with their logos on it without permission.<P>I looked at the vw newsgroup and seen the problem has gotten worse.  Vwoa is now harassing web owners and business owners that they are using a logo in their domain name.  VWoa sends out an email stating they will be brought to court if they dont shut down.  <P>A guy who restores vws for a living is going to court to fight his battle.  vwoa has sent him a letter that they dont like his website because it contains his logo.  <P>Here is a site that is collecting supporters.  Reading the guestbook will give you more info about this subject.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.vwmagazine.com/vwoa/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.vwmagazine.com/vwoa/</A> <P>newsgroup<BR>rec.autos.makers.vw.aircooled<P>website vwoa is trying to take <A HREF="http://www.classicvws.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.classicvws.com</A> ||||reg||1
